<title>FINLAND: TIETO BUYS NORWAY CO WITH NOK 12 MLN SALES.</title>
<headline>TIETO BUYS NORWAY CO WITH NOK 12 MLN SALES.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish data systems group TT Tieto Oy said in a statement on Tuesday it had bought Norwegian software reengineering and internet/intranet company GC Computer AS for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>&quot;CG Computer's net sales are 12 million Norwegian crowns and it employs 12 people,&quot; Tieto said.</p>
<p>CG Computer's founder Michael Wittwater would stay as the company's managing director, it said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358 - 9 - 680 50 242</p>
</text>
